  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834186000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac, and you've reached VeloFit Customer Support. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834195600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to make a return.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834203200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly assist you with that. To pull up your account, could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834205000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Doe. Order 7-8-6-5-5-3.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834212533333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. I see the order here for the Pro-Weave Cycling Jersey. Just to understand the situation better, what specifically is the issue with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834214599999
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834225333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I understand. So is it a preference issue with the fit, or do you believe it was labeled incorrectly?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834226866665
    },
    {
      "text": "The jersey is just too tight. I need to send it back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834234199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Let me just check the delivery date here... I see it was delivered 58 days ago. Let me review our return eligibility for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834237933331
    },
    {
      "text": "I would hope so.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834247199997
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely. And... yes, you are unfortunately outside our 10-day return window for standard apparel. I can definitely process this for you. Would you prefer a refund, or would you like to exchange it for a different size?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834248466663
    },
    {
      "text": "An exchange, I guess. If you have the next size up.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834262733329
    },
    {
      "text": "We certainly do. And Jane, I see here you're one of our VIP members. As a thank you for your loyalty, I'm going to process that exchange for you right away and I'll also waive the return shipping fee. I've just sent a prepaid return label to your email on file.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834266333329
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. That's acceptable.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93835,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834283933329
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. The new jersey in the correct size will ship out as soon as the carrier scans your return package. Is there anything else I can help you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768834285733329
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's it.",
